### Case: orders-repeated-id — a caller adds another customer's id.
###
### Expect 200 and only customer 1's orders. The backend received
### GET /users/1/todos?userId=2 and took the id from the path. After the
### "backend moved" variation it receives /todos?userId=1&userId=2 instead, and
### returns customers 1 and 2.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/v1/customers/1/orders?userId=2
accept: application/json
